om: Mme Perron</title><link>https://sta-russell.cdsbeo.on.ca/apps/pages/DailyAnnouncements</link><description>&lt;p&gt;There will be a Europe Team meeting tomorrow at lunch in room 125 All travelers must attend&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">89564853240225747de27c601a09ea392f168c7f9e7ffe84451feb6f3b9bcbc4</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:40:46 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>A message from Ms. Clune:</title><link>https://sta-russell.cdsbeo.on.ca/apps/pages/DailyAnnouncements</link><description>&lt;p&gt;No 7/8 Cross Country today. Our next practice will be on Thursday.&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e81cb26ad65387b2f4bfdc80b5ce0982423d43fbcd827062fb20cca5ce7ecda0</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:40:46 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>A message from: Mr. G:</title><link>https://sta-russell.cdsbeo.on.ca/apps/pages/DailyAnnouncements</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Anyone interested in being a part of the STA dance team is invited to a tryout tomorrow at 2:15 in the Atrium.&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">a76599d5f74477454a287d4ce7415674dc6445962e83be91b657507f43ffe1a0</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:40:46 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>A message from Mrs. Kwok.</title><link>https://sta-russell.cdsbeo.on.ca/apps/pages/DailyAnnouncements</link><description>&lt;p&gt;There is a Unity Club meeting today at lunch in room 208. Everyone is welcome.&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e11628c1e8d734ea8b48e2baa8e307a6ecde2e2965aa0eefe55115ee80c46747</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:40:46 -0400</pubDate></item></channel></rss>